        "filing_date": "2026-03-27",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Although we operate in several distinct segments of the flat panel display semiconductor industry, our principal products are display drivers.",
        "start_character": 9911,
        "end_character": 10053
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-035507",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-035507-1e4e73dd67edd086",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-035507",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As a result, we expect that we will continue to rely on a limited number of semiconductor manufacturing service providers for a substantial portion of our manufacturing requirements in the near future.",
        "start_character": 103400,
        "end_character": 103601
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-035507",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-035507-1e4e73dd67edd086",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-035507",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Based on the technologies and IP we developed, on top of legacy products for laptop and multimedia we have been supplying, our product lines have been expanded to cover three domains: ultralow power computer vision- Always-On Sensor (“AoS”), Near Infrared (“NIR”) sensor, and big pixel BSI sensors in automotive and surveillance.",
        "start_character": 57318,
        "end_character": 57647
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-035507",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-035507-1e4e73dd67edd086",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-035507",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Building on this milestone, we are expanding globally through collaborations with other leading door lock manufacturers to integrate advanced AI features such as parcel recognition, anti-pinch protection, and palm vein biometric authentication, further broadening the application scope and enhancing product differentiation.",
        "start_character": 80005,
        "end_character": 80329
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-035507",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-035507-1e4e73dd67edd086",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-035507",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For certain products or regions, we may sell our products through agents or distributors.",
        "start_character": 94219,
        "end_character": 94308
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-035507",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-035507-1e4e73dd67edd086",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-035507",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For wafer level optics products, we face competition primarily from Heptagon that was acquired by ams AG and certain new optical design houses from China, such as Angstrong Tech, Yuguang Science and Technology Development Co.",
        "start_character": 108834,
        "end_character": 109059
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-035507",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-035507-1e4e73dd67edd086",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-035507",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Furthermore, we extend our business development with system and ODM companies by using strategic ASIC business model to not only develop ASIC product based on customer specification but also jointly research and develop new technologies to meet customers’ future product demand.",
        "start_character": 93014,
        "end_character": 93292
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-035507",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-035507-1e4e73dd67edd086",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-035507",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also market our products directly to TV, monitor, notebook and mobile, tablet and automotive device manufacturers so that our products can be qualified for their specifications and designed into their products.",
        "start_character": 92800,
        "end_character": 93013
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-035507",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-035507-1e4e73dd67edd086",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-035507",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are collaborating closely with leading panel makers across China, Japan and Korea for OLED product development in smartphone, tablet, automotive and others.",
        "start_character": 36701,
        "end_character": 36860
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-035507",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-035507-1e4e73dd67edd086",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-035507",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are selective in our choice of semiconductor manufacturing service providers.",
        "start_character": 103189,
        "end_character": 103269
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-035507",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-035507-1e4e73dd67edd086",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-035507",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We focus our sales and marketing strategy on establishing business and technology relationships principally with Panel Manufacturers, using LTPS and a-Si TFT-LCD, and OLED technologies, mobile display module and mobile device manufacturers for smartphone, tablet and automotive, and camera module houses in order to work closely with them on future semiconductor solutions that align with their product road maps.",
        "start_character": 92066,
        "end_character": 92479
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-035507",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-035507-1e4e73dd67edd086",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-035507",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have developed a comprehensive 3D structured light sensing solution to explore business opportunities across various industries.",
